<title>USA: Reflectone shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Reflectone shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reflectone Inc said Tuesday its shareholders approved the company's merger with a unit of British Aerospace Plc.</p>
<p>Under the merger agreement approved, Reflectone shareholders will receive $24.00 per share, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Reflectone manufactures flight simulators and air defense training systems as well as simulation-based entertainment devices.</p>
</text>
